    ],
    "text": "I, Roshan Goonetileke, the Governor of the Western Province, do hereby notify the following Regulation be enacted in terms of the powers vested in me under Section 7 of the Establishment of Housing Development Fund Statute, No.03 of 1990 in the Western Province read with Article 154 (C) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
