    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      126.12,
      549.81,
      152.76
    ],
    "text": "01. These Regulations may be cited as the Regulations to provide Housing Aids for Low Income recipients of Western Province No. 02 of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      166.62,
      549.83,
      193.26
    ],
    "text": "02. The Housing Aids provided to low income recipients by the Housing Development Fund of Western Province shall be in accordance with the values mentioned under following categories.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      246.94,
      212.65,
      473.03,
      225.95
    ],
    "text": "CategoryValue",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      110.6,
      235.74,
      383.18,
      272.88
    ],
    "text": "01.5 'a' (1)Building a new house The Maximum amount of aid paid to a receipient(2 installments)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      186.54,
      283.74,
      419.39,
      296.88
    ],
    "text": "(i) When ready to commence the work- Rs. 150,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      186.54,
      307.74,
      423.0,
      332.88
    ],
    "text": "(ii) To complete the remaining work of the partly built house - Rs. 150,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      431.84,
      236.08,
      492.0,
      249.22
    ],
    "text": "Rs. 300,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
