    ],
    "text": "Rs. 200,000.00",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      457.93,
      549.8,
      484.57
    ],
    "text": "03. Providing of the Housing Aids under these Regulations shall be done while maintaining a minimum balance of Rs. Sixty (60) Million in the Housing Development Fund all the time.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      498.43,
      549.81,
      538.57
    ],
    "text": "04. The Regulations related to providing Housing Aids for Low Income Recipients of Western Province published in the Extraordinary Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, No. 2318/51 dated 10th February, 2023 shall be repealed from the date on which these Regulations come into effect.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.31,
      552.43,
      549.81,
      579.07
    ],
    "text": "05. Under these Regulations, \"a low income recipient\" means a person who earns a monthly income not exceeding a maximum of Rs. Fifteen Thousand.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.31,
      592.93,
      549.81,
      619.57
    ],
    "text": "06. In the event of any inconsistency between Sinhala, Tamil and English texts of these Regulations the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
